title: Stegerwald new Chancellor
subtitle: Ebert appoints Adam Stegerwald of the Z chnacellor.
view-if: bourgeois_united_front >= 1 and year <= 1924 and (month <= 4 if year == 1924)
max-visits: 1 
tags: event 
new-page: true 
face-image: img/portraits/StegerwaldAdam.jpg 

= Stegerwald to be Chancellor

With our party out of government talks, the <span style="color: [+ dnvp_colour +];">**DNVP**</span> will be approached for discussing a majority bourgeois coalition. They have shown themselves ready to compromise after having rebuffed some other offers before but they still demand to be included in Prussia which would naturally kick us out of the coalition.

- @dnvp_enters_prussia: We will be expelled from Prussia
- @no_compromise: The Centrists prefer us over the <span style="color: [+ dnvp_colour +];">**DNVP**</span>

@dnvp_enters_prussia
